{"version":1,"content":"<p>日劇天王木村拓哉日前一連兩場的台灣演唱會，已經圓滿落幕，吸引合共約1萬人捧場。</p><p>前日，他離開台灣返回台灣前，突襲所屬事務所的在台灣官方週邊商店「巡舖」，在櫥窗簽名，又親民與店內的粉絲擊掌。</p><p>他此行在台灣又趁機大擦地道美食，大啖菜脯蛋、杏仁豆腐</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:19:09.973304+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T14:03:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T14:12:20.127641+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:12:20.127641+00:00","content_hash":"d845381e78dfef84f72ccd7ef809a3d45e66e964db2a17f7a18f5f6d8eab799c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}